# The Stalker's Hollow's bone pit (CIPlay stalkers_hollow_spikes, 11-08; in a test world, under CIGapsWatchHealth): the
# sand hollow on the sea floor (h 3) east of the lip rock, past the den dome's foot (flattened to h=1 along 66.5..71.5 x
# 62.5, moved 11-09), three stakes with spike zones shspike1-3 at x 67, 69, 71 (radius 1.5, damage 4, safe=none), plank
# ledges along both rims (z 64.6 and 60.4), the sign at 64.5 62.5.
# The hollow floor is real floor (expect stand), standing on it costs health, the planks do not.
island The Stalker's Hollow keep
offset 0.6508 1.0124
hour 11
weather Calm
expect stand 67 62.5 h=1 below=3
expect stand 71 62.5 h=1 below=3
expect stand 68.25 64.6 h=2.5 below=4
picture sh_pit_out 69 8 70 69 1 62.5
at 69 62.5 h=1.5
wait 3
picture sh_spikes 69 4.5 66 69 1 62.5
wait 3
at 68.25 64.6 h=4
wait 2
picture sh_pit_ledge 64.5 5 64.6 72 3 61
